@startuml
title R12 video input — frame-to-track flow (M1)

|User / FPT-Mentor|
start
:Supply ego-POV clip matching the A-B-C scenario;
:B visible and occluding the lane ahead, C never in frame;

|Build (CI / developer)|
:Preflight the clip with ffprobe against the agreed spec;
if (container/codec/resolution/fps/duration within spec?) then (no)
  :Reject the clip, report the failing attribute;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:COPY media/ into the ADA ECU image at /app/media/;

|ADA ECU detector subprocess|
:Read VIDEO_CLIP_PATH and DETECTOR_FRAME_STRIDE from env;
:Open the clip with OpenCV VideoCapture;
repeat
  :Read next frame;
  if (frame index modulo stride equals 0?) then (yes)
    :Run YOLO11n ONNX on the letterboxed frame;
    :Estimate distance for each vehicle detection;
    :Emit one R3 TrackedObject JSONL line with source own_sensor;
  else (no)
  endif
repeat while (frames remaining?) is (yes)
->no;

|ADA ECU core|
:Ingest R3 JSONL from the subprocess stdout;
:Admit own-sensor tracks through the R13 state machine;
:Compose the scene with relayed C and emit R4 warnings;
:Assert zero detections labeled C over the whole run;
stop

@enduml
